# Copy this file to .env in the repository root, then add your key locally.
# Never commit .env or share its contents.
# Backend-only Meta Model API credential. The current adapter reads this exact name.
MODEL_API_KEY=

# The CLI does not automatically load .env. Use uv run --env-file .env ...
# Scanning, the viewer and disabled/mock explanations do not need an API key.
# Provider selection remains an explicit CLI argument; adding a key starts no calls.
# Never put this key in frontend files or a VITE_* variable.
